<title>POLAND: JELFA JULY NET RISES TO PLN 6.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>JELFA JULY NET RISES TO PLN 6.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.62 vs   1.52</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 9.54 vs   2.20</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.21 vs   2.13</p>
<p> Sales		   13.08 vs  13.06</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    21.53 vs  12.54</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	31.21 vs  18.05</p>
<p> Operating profit    26.65 vs  16.62</p>
<p> Sales		  106.79 vs  86.08</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish drug maker is Przedsiebiorstwo</p>
<p>Farmaceutyczne Jelfa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
